# Common raven

The common raven is the raven in this notebook. Its name is the key
`common-raven`; [[field-notes]] records one observation.

It follows [[barn-owl]] in an alphabetically sorted map, but follows
[[european-robin]] and the owl on the notebook's authored route.
See [[collection-views]] for the two orders.
